(6083762, 895695, 96513, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had a much better viewing spot than I did.</td>', 'Looks like you had a much better viewing spot than I did.', '2010-07-07 10:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6083792, 896098, 29009, '<td valign="top">It was hard to get the focus on the bubbles, I''m sure.  The main problem with this is that these boats don''t make a good background for these bubbles.  It''s an unusual pairing, and the boats compete for attention even though I can see you''ve used DOF to isolate your subject matter.  Did you have trouble with underexposure?  Looks a bit noisy/grainy which detracts from fun shiny bubbles.  Next time, try isolating just a few of the bubbles and have the boats as a reflection in them.  Your border is also not helping your presentation.<br/> <br/>Your concept of lots of bubbles floating around might work better in a different challenge.</td>', 'It was hard to get the focus on the bubbles, I''m sure.  The main problem with this is that these boats don''t make a good background for these bubbles.  It''s an unusual pairing, and the boats compete for attention even though I can see you''ve used DOF to isolate your subject matter.  Did you have trouble with underexposure?  Looks a bit noisy/grainy which detracts from fun shiny bubbles.  Next time, try isolating just a few of the bubbles and have the boats as a reflection in them.  Your border is also not helping your presentation. Your concept of lots of bubbles floating around might work better in a different challenge.', '2010-07-07 11:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6083799, 896206, 117559, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, but I find it calming -not chaotic.</td>', 'Lovely image, but I find it calming -not chaotic.', '2010-07-07 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6083800, 896240, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is definitely the best fireworks photo in the challenge.</td>', 'This is definitely the best fireworks photo in the challenge.', '2010-07-07 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
