(6085424, 896072, 28710, '<td valign="top">Chaos? Lost me there. Nice pic of the kid tho.</td>', 'Chaos? Lost me there. Nice pic of the kid tho.', '2010-07-08 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085426, 896240, 28710, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool. One of the more ''chaotic'' feeling fireworks shots. Could probably use a bit of a punch in the curves or levels. Seems your white point is really low.</td>', 'That''s pretty cool. One of the more ''chaotic'' feeling fireworks shots. Could probably use a bit of a punch in the curves or levels. Seems your white point is really low.', '2010-07-08 12:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085428, 895666, 28710, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty cool and I think it''s pretty well captured, but I think I''d like this better if it were cropped in about 25% so it wasn''t obvious that it was water in a glass.</td>', 'Looks pretty cool and I think it''s pretty well captured, but I think I''d like this better if it were cropped in about 25% so it wasn''t obvious that it was water in a glass.', '2010-07-08 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085430, 894848, 28710, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but this one doesn''t hit me where it probably ought to.<br/> <br/>I see the contrasting elements of light and dark in the top left and right hand corners, but I don''t really feel the girl''s emotion. I see outcry, but I don''t feel her pain.<br/> <br/>Which is odd given my personal background with mental disorders in the family.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but this one doesn''t hit me where it probably ought to. I see the contrasting elements of light and dark in the top left and right hand corners, but I don''t really feel the girl''s emotion. I see outcry, but I don''t feel her pain. Which is odd given my personal background with mental disorders in the family.', '2010-07-08 12:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085433, 896253, 28710, '<td valign="top">Honestly, this needs a counterpoint.<br/> <br/>A dirty fingertip. A faint face in the background. Anything... Otherwise, it''s just a picture of a match. And not a super great one at that.<br/> <br/>If there was a face reminiscent of Jack Nicholson with dementia, the noise visible here could easily be redeemed.</td>', 'Honestly, this needs a counterpoint. A dirty fingertip. A faint face in the background. Anything... Otherwise, it''s just a picture of a match. And not a super great one at that. If there was a face reminiscent of Jack Nicholson with dementia, the noise visible here could easily be redeemed.', '2010-07-08 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085434, 895705, 28710, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the chaos. That''s just one scooter in front of a door.?</td>', 'I don''t see the chaos. That''s just one scooter in front of a door.?', '2010-07-08 12:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085436, 895694, 28710, '<td valign="top">oooooh. Looks like a creepy clown''s face in top left.</td>', 'oooooh. Looks like a creepy clown''s face in top left.', '2010-07-08 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085437, 895708, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hate the border. The rest is pretty fun tho</td>', 'Hate the border. The rest is pretty fun tho', '2010-07-08 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085438, 896145, 28710, '<td valign="top">Planted by a person in the ground is chaotic? I must be missing something.<br/> <br/>I''ve always found fireworks to be a demonstration of man''s mastery over fire rather than a chaotic free for all, but that''s probably just me.</td>', 'Planted by a person in the ground is chaotic? I must be missing something. I''ve always found fireworks to be a demonstration of man''s mastery over fire rather than a chaotic free for all, but that''s probably just me.', '2010-07-08 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085440, 896039, 28710, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots where I genuinely see Chaos in action. Very nicely done with the near perfect perpendicular on the stems (although it''s pretty obvious that the glasses are laid out on a light table)...<br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'One of the few shots where I genuinely see Chaos in action. Very nicely done with the near perfect perpendicular on the stems (although it''s pretty obvious that the glasses are laid out on a light table)... Good job!', '2010-07-08 12:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6085445, 895532, 28710, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I quite liked this shot. Something about it grabbed me.<br/> <br/>It''s ultra-noisy and doesn''t look all that great up close, but visually, it''s very pleasing. <br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I quite liked this shot. Something about it grabbed me. It''s ultra-noisy and doesn''t look all that great up close, but visually, it''s very pleasing.  7', '2010-07-08 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
