(6087412, 895705, 117474, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the chaos here I''m afraid. Is it in the deteriation of the signage of the building? I like the shot but don''t really see the chaos. <br/>You''ve probably got a few of these comments. I''ll refrain from voting for the mean time until I think about it a little more.<br/> <br/>Later: I''m still not sure :)<br/>It''s totally the chaos that would be caused by that bad parking, isn''t it? <br/>D''oh! I''m glad I didn''t vote straight away. I like the angle you took on it. Processing''s fine (I''d''ve made the shadows darker, but I like dark and have suffered from being too dark previously). Nice composition. I might have cropped it a little tighter on the right so you don''t see a little bit of the signs. Maybe even right up to the 36, but that''s not a big deal.</td>', 'I don''t see the chaos here I''m afraid. Is it in the deteriation of the signage of the building? I like the shot but don''t really see the chaos. You''ve probably got a few of these comments. I''ll refrain from voting for the mean time until I think about it a little more. Later: I''m still not sure :)It''s totally the chaos that would be caused by that bad parking, isn''t it? D''oh! I''m glad I didn''t vote straight away. I like the angle you took on it. Processing''s fine (I''d''ve made the shadows darker, but I like dark and have suffered from being too dark previously). Nice composition. I might have cropped it a little tighter on the right so you don''t see a little bit of the signs. Maybe even right up to the 36, but that''s not a big deal.', '2010-07-10 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
