(6090679, 895360, 18207, '<td valign="top">:) Made me smile. One that uses has an easy feeling - no (apparent) special attention to technical stuff, just like a happy snapshot in the best sense.<br/>But still, if you give this a second though, you''ll find more behind it. Good one!</td>', ':) Made me smile. One that uses has an easy feeling - no (apparent) special attention to technical stuff, just like a happy snapshot in the best sense.But still, if you give this a second though, you''ll find more behind it. Good one!', '2010-07-13 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
