(6090873, 896158, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, but it''s not doing anything to grab my attention, I''m afraid. I''m curious what the color version looks like.</td>', 'An interesting subject, but it''s not doing anything to grab my attention, I''m afraid. I''m curious what the color version looks like.', '2010-07-13 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090877, 895290, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like fuzzy llammas, but all I see here are the ducks of chaos. <strike>Now I''m gonna have the llama llamma song stuck in my head the rest of the day.</strike> Nevermind. When the next entry came up, it was replaced with "Roly poly fish heads". Make sure to post a link to the llama song after the challenge.</td>', 'I like fuzzy llammas, but all I see here are the ducks of chaos. Now I''m gonna have the llama llamma song stuck in my head the rest of the day. Nevermind. When the next entry came up, it was replaced with "Roly poly fish heads". Make sure to post a link to the llama song after the challenge.', '2010-07-13 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090879, 895705, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how this illustrates chaos. I''m sure it does for you somehow, but I''m dense.</td>', 'Not really sure how this illustrates chaos. I''m sure it does for you somehow, but I''m dense.', '2010-07-13 15:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090882, 896262, 83313, '<td valign="top">That''s some tough squirrels you have in your neighborhood.</td>', 'That''s some tough squirrels you have in your neighborhood.', '2010-07-13 15:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090889, 896173, 83313, '<td valign="top">My wife thought this was my photo when it came up for her to vote on, since we had shot some near-identical pics a few weeks ago. Definitely chaotic! I think some levels, contrast and saturation adjustments would have helped the visual impact of this image. It looks somewhat flat to me.</td>', 'My wife thought this was my photo when it came up for her to vote on, since we had shot some near-identical pics a few weeks ago. Definitely chaotic! I think some levels, contrast and saturation adjustments would have helped the visual impact of this image. It looks somewhat flat to me.', '2010-07-13 15:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090894, 896052, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing this as terribly chaotic, but a lot of entries in this challenge don''t quite fit my definition, so perhaps it just me. Certainly an unusual scene.</td>', 'I''m not seeing this as terribly chaotic, but a lot of entries in this challenge don''t quite fit my definition, so perhaps it just me. Certainly an unusual scene.', '2010-07-13 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090986, 896039, 118778, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. I love the composition and almost symmetry.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. I love the composition and almost symmetry.', '2010-07-13 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090994, 896206, 118778, '<td valign="top">I love the amazing coloring and gorgeous contrasts here.</td>', 'I love the amazing coloring and gorgeous contrasts here.', '2010-07-13 16:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090999, 894863, 118778, '<td valign="top">Very original and inspiring.</td>', 'Very original and inspiring.', '2010-07-13 16:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091002, 896262, 118778, '<td valign="top">Very cool. It looks like a tree I saw on Beaver Island once.</td>', 'Very cool. It looks like a tree I saw on Beaver Island once.', '2010-07-13 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091005, 895171, 118778, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The different colors of the pinheads are very cool. :)</td>', 'Interesting. The different colors of the pinheads are very cool. :)', '2010-07-13 16:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091008, 895694, 118778, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and inspired.</td>', 'Gorgeous and inspired.', '2010-07-13 16:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091017, 895743, 118778, '<td valign="top">I love this.</td>', 'I love this.', '2010-07-13 16:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091021, 895142, 118778, '<td valign="top">This one is gorgeous and awe inspiring. I love it.</td>', 'This one is gorgeous and awe inspiring. I love it.', '2010-07-13 16:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091023, 895916, 118778, '<td valign="top">Amazing</td>', 'Amazing', '2010-07-13 16:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091025, 896103, 118778, '<td valign="top">Cute. What a great capture!</td>', 'Cute. What a great capture!', '2010-07-13 16:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091031, 895666, 118778, '<td valign="top">Wow. That''s really... words fail me. Very cool.</td>', 'Wow. That''s really... words fail me. Very cool.', '2010-07-13 16:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091061, 896110, 117314, '<td valign="top">lol.. for the title.</td>', 'lol.. for the title.', '2010-07-13 16:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091191, 895290, 119417, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice use of BW vs. color. The highlights on the ducks seem a little washed out, though, and I''d have preferred if the back of the man''s head weren''t cut off.</td>', 'Good idea and nice use of BW vs. color. The highlights on the ducks seem a little washed out, though, and I''d have preferred if the back of the man''s head weren''t cut off.', '2010-07-13 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091194, 895532, 119417, '<td valign="top">The lack of sharp focus really detracts for me.</td>', 'The lack of sharp focus really detracts for me.', '2010-07-13 17:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091196, 895694, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice action and the lighting in the smoke is dramatic.  I don''t know about the composition, though--the negative space isn''t used all that well or to purposeful effect, leaving the result feeling empty.</td>', 'Nice action and the lighting in the smoke is dramatic.  I don''t know about the composition, though--the negative space isn''t used all that well or to purposeful effect, leaving the result feeling empty.', '2010-07-13 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091201, 894795, 119417, '<td valign="top">This is a motion blur attempt, I guess?  I tend to think that motion blur works best when it''s there for a reason, rather than just there to be there.  As in, to portray action or speed.  Here I imagine you were trying to convey "chaos," but it just looks messy to me.  I also really don''t understand why the fingers are there.</td>', 'This is a motion blur attempt, I guess?  I tend to think that motion blur works best when it''s there for a reason, rather than just there to be there.  As in, to portray action or speed.  Here I imagine you were trying to convey "chaos," but it just looks messy to me.  I also really don''t understand why the fingers are there.', '2010-07-13 17:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091205, 896042, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting a lot, but I don''t know how well it represents the theme of chaos. Perhaps a wider shot, including more plants would feel more chaotic. Still, this is a very pleasing shot.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting a lot, but I don''t know how well it represents the theme of chaos. Perhaps a wider shot, including more plants would feel more chaotic. Still, this is a very pleasing shot.', '2010-07-13 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091207, 896240, 119417, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this feels chaotic.  But in a good way.  I''m having trouble figuring out how you did this--it looks upside-down no matter which way I turn it.  Impressive.</td>', 'Wow, now this feels chaotic.  But in a good way.  I''m having trouble figuring out how you did this--it looks upside-down no matter which way I turn it.  Impressive.', '2010-07-13 17:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091209, 896076, 119417, '<td valign="top">This could be improved a lot with better, more directional lighting.  I like the idea, but the harsh light kills it for me.</td>', 'This could be improved a lot with better, more directional lighting.  I like the idea, but the harsh light kills it for me.', '2010-07-13 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091213, 895455, 119417, '<td valign="top">A parking lot seems like a great idea for potential chaos, but I don''t get much of a sense of that here.  As for the technical parts, the blown highlights in the sky are a problem, and the white balance appears to be off.  The angle is also kind of boring--a higher or lower angle would make this more interesting, instead of just taking it from a standing position as it appears you''ve done.  Main thing is to really think about what''s being included in the image and why.</td>', 'A parking lot seems like a great idea for potential chaos, but I don''t get much of a sense of that here.  As for the technical parts, the blown highlights in the sky are a problem, and the white balance appears to be off.  The angle is also kind of boring--a higher or lower angle would make this more interesting, instead of just taking it from a standing position as it appears you''ve done.  Main thing is to really think about what''s being included in the image and why.', '2010-07-13 17:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091215, 896077, 119417, '<td valign="top">Here I think a tighter crop would work much better.  Also a lower angle.  As it is, this doesn''t feel well planned.  The tilt is also very jarring.</td>', 'Here I think a tighter crop would work much better.  Also a lower angle.  As it is, this doesn''t feel well planned.  The tilt is also very jarring.', '2010-07-13 17:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091222, 896039, 119417, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love that the two glasses are at right angles, which adds a more orderly feeling to the chaotic moment.  The only thing I might prefer is if the composition were less centered.  This has a lot of potential for using negative space with a wider crop, especially if the shards were breaking in a more directional pattern (hard to do, I know).  But as is, it''s very good.</td>', 'Great capture. I love that the two glasses are at right angles, which adds a more orderly feeling to the chaotic moment.  The only thing I might prefer is if the composition were less centered.  This has a lot of potential for using negative space with a wider crop, especially if the shards were breaking in a more directional pattern (hard to do, I know).  But as is, it''s very good.', '2010-07-13 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091223, 896047, 119417, '<td valign="top">Colors are a little oversaturated for me and the whole thing feels too soft.  I give kudos for a good concept, though.</td>', 'Colors are a little oversaturated for me and the whole thing feels too soft.  I give kudos for a good concept, though.', '2010-07-13 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091226, 896209, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, good  lighting, good representation of the concept. Good contrast. Might work even better with a fisheye lens.</td>', 'Nice angle, good  lighting, good representation of the concept. Good contrast. Might work even better with a fisheye lens.', '2010-07-13 18:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091229, 896153, 119417, '<td valign="top">I love pictures of texture and walls and what have you. I don''t know that I feel much in the way of "chaos" here, though.  I get "texture," and possibly "decay," but not really "chaos."</td>', 'I love pictures of texture and walls and what have you. I don''t know that I feel much in the way of "chaos" here, though.  I get "texture," and possibly "decay," but not really "chaos."', '2010-07-13 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091234, 896024, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly great composition, I don''t think.  Would be better from a lower angle and much closer in. The bare patch of dirt at the bottom is wasted space, and I also don''t think the house at left or the tree in the background add anything.  The focus here is the junk, so that should be what fills the frame.</td>', 'Not a particularly great composition, I don''t think.  Would be better from a lower angle and much closer in. The bare patch of dirt at the bottom is wasted space, and I also don''t think the house at left or the tree in the background add anything.  The focus here is the junk, so that should be what fills the frame.', '2010-07-13 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091236, 895727, 119417, '<td valign="top">Good fireworks technique. Composition might be improved a bit with a little rotation, but not bad at all. If I hadn''t already seen a fireworks shot that really filled the frame with light, I''d probably rate this one higher.</td>', 'Good fireworks technique. Composition might be improved a bit with a little rotation, but not bad at all. If I hadn''t already seen a fireworks shot that really filled the frame with light, I''d probably rate this one higher.', '2010-07-13 18:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091237, 896098, 119417, '<td valign="top">The bubbles are nice, especially the one at center right that is really sharply in focus. I wish that there were more of them, and I also think the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'The bubbles are nice, especially the one at center right that is really sharply in focus. I wish that there were more of them, and I also think the background is a little distracting.', '2010-07-13 18:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091238, 895360, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I''d wish for a little more fill toward the bottom left, but I''m not sure how to accomplish that, really, especially with a long exposure. The smoke detracts a bit, though--I think it would be a better image if the background were more flat black.</td>', 'Not bad.  I''d wish for a little more fill toward the bottom left, but I''m not sure how to accomplish that, really, especially with a long exposure. The smoke detracts a bit, though--I think it would be a better image if the background were more flat black.', '2010-07-13 18:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091243, 895301, 119417, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really feel very "frenzied" to me.  It just looks like you moved a fork around.  Motion blur has a lot of potential for a topic like "chaos," but you have to have the right subject.</td>', 'This doesn''t really feel very "frenzied" to me.  It just looks like you moved a fork around.  Motion blur has a lot of potential for a topic like "chaos," but you have to have the right subject.', '2010-07-13 18:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091248, 896023, 119417, '<td valign="top">Oh, very clever. Just seeing that is making me grit my teeth! A higher angle, looking straight down, would be even better, but I know that would be difficult.  Other nitpicks: I could do without the tree/bush in the bottom left, the square cover at the top left, and the car at center left is cut off a little too short for me. But, man, I love the concept.</td>', 'Oh, very clever. Just seeing that is making me grit my teeth! A higher angle, looking straight down, would be even better, but I know that would be difficult.  Other nitpicks: I could do without the tree/bush in the bottom left, the square cover at the top left, and the car at center left is cut off a little too short for me. But, man, I love the concept.', '2010-07-13 18:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091249, 896093, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good use of negative space. Colors are too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Nice capture, good use of negative space. Colors are too saturated for my taste.', '2010-07-13 18:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091252, 896133, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but I don''t think it says "chaos" so much as "decay."</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but I don''t think it says "chaos" so much as "decay."', '2010-07-13 18:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091257, 894844, 119417, '<td valign="top">Messy, yes, but really not that messy.  I saw another shot that was of an entire room covered in clutter. This is just kind of a boring snapshot, without interesting lighting or composition. Get in closer to the stuff under the screen, use a wide lens, and light it better, and you''ll be onto something.</td>', 'Messy, yes, but really not that messy.  I saw another shot that was of an entire room covered in clutter. This is just kind of a boring snapshot, without interesting lighting or composition. Get in closer to the stuff under the screen, use a wide lens, and light it better, and you''ll be onto something.', '2010-07-13 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091259, 895830, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections on the honey (I think that''s honey) and the composition is quite good. It does feel a little overprocessed to me, though. A lot of the texture is being lost in the highlights, and the grain detracts.  For this to really work, I think, it would need to be razor sharp.</td>', 'I like the reflections on the honey (I think that''s honey) and the composition is quite good. It does feel a little overprocessed to me, though. A lot of the texture is being lost in the highlights, and the grain detracts.  For this to really work, I think, it would need to be razor sharp.', '2010-07-13 18:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091260, 896110, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I don''t really know why. None of the individual aspects or elements works for me, but together it''s interesting. Not sure about "chaotic" but certainly interesting.</td>', 'I like this, but I don''t really know why. None of the individual aspects or elements works for me, but together it''s interesting. Not sure about "chaotic" but certainly interesting.', '2010-07-13 18:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091262, 896052, 119417, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this seems very chaotic, though it is a neat documentary snap. The piano is a little bright and too saturated for my taste, and I''d want the piano and player to be sharper. Also, a tighter crop might help.</td>', 'I don''t think this seems very chaotic, though it is a neat documentary snap. The piano is a little bright and too saturated for my taste, and I''d want the piano and player to be sharper. Also, a tighter crop might help.', '2010-07-13 18:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091264, 895916, 119417, '<td valign="top">Ooo, that is a neat effect. What a great idea, having the leaf "dissolving" into the water that way. Very cool.</td>', 'Ooo, that is a neat effect. What a great idea, having the leaf "dissolving" into the water that way. Very cool.', '2010-07-13 18:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091265, 896210, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think this should be tighter in, and if the haziness of the smoke gets in the way of the action.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think this should be tighter in, and if the haziness of the smoke gets in the way of the action.', '2010-07-13 18:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091269, 895705, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice street grab.  Slightly tighter crop would be more my preference, but well done all the same.</td>', 'Nice street grab.  Slightly tighter crop would be more my preference, but well done all the same.', '2010-07-13 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091272, 895142, 119417, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. I like the black background. Colors are too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Neat idea. I like the black background. Colors are too saturated for my taste.', '2010-07-13 18:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6091273, 895440, 119417, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great angle. Good composition--I like the two squares balancing each other.  The shadow at bottom left is unfortunate, though.</td>', 'Great idea and great angle. Good composition--I like the two squares balancing each other.  The shadow at bottom left is unfortunate, though.', '2010-07-13 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
