(6156594, 896096, 95687, '<td valign="top">what is an HM?<br/> <br/>This shot leads me to believe you are gelling your flashes - this is brilliant color combinations.  Makes me want to shoot tabletop some more.  I believe that makes you inspirational!  Yes, I''m almost certain you are inspiring.  :-)</td>', 'what is an HM? This shot leads me to believe you are gelling your flashes - this is brilliant color combinations.  Makes me want to shoot tabletop some more.  I believe that makes you inspirational!  Yes, I''m almost certain you are inspiring.  :-)', '2010-09-08 15:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
